{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1539964-fourth-member","id":1539964,"title":"Fourth member","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-06T19:12:58-07:00","id":1539964,"title":"Fourth member","content":"Basically I need a fourth member for a cortege and I need ideas for one who would complement the group along with some background for him. A summary of the others:<br /> <br /> A Brujah who takes care of network security and is a cyberactivist in his spare time, but he isn't the stereotypical anti-social hacker, actually he is quite good at socializing, but lacks in the physical department;<br /> <br /> A Malkavian who has always been involved in crime and has done almost everything, he is the violent type, and short-tempered to the point that he is mistaken for a Brujah (yes, the flaw), naturally he is the muscle of the group, the shooter and the getaway pilot when necessary;<br /> <br /> The third is a Caitff, who does not know who his sire is, because he lost his memory and there is no identity or birth record linked to him, legally he doesn't even exist. He has a unique discipline that works like Vicissitude, but faster and limited to his own body. He is also good at acting and opening locks, has knowledge of human anatomy, but is terrible with technology.<br /> <br /> That's basically it, making it clear that is an anarch cortege and for certain reasons, the fourth member cannot be a Tremere or even have any proficiency in thaumaturgy. Other than that, he can be almost anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-06T20:22:16-07:00","id":1539966,"title":"","content":"What is this coterie about? Under which circumstances did they got acquainted and decided to do stuff together? What's their business right now?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T08:47:25-07:00","id":1539990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1539964-fourth-member?p=1539966#post1539966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is this coterie about? Under which circumstances did they got acquainted and decided to do stuff together? What's their business right now?</div> </div> </div> </div>Answering the first two questions, the cortege was gathered by the Baron to resolve internal problems in a more discreet way that he could not get directly involved in. So he gathered his child, a Brujah named Erika, whom he trusts, and put the Malkavian so that she would be protected, the Caitff was because his ability is useful and so Erika could keep an eye on him, since he is naturally very suspicious. That was the original purpose, but the group remained together for reasons of personal interest, so if one of them has problems, the others help as best they can, but without taking too many risks. Very basic, really. I could put more details, but I will need the fourth member first.<br /> <br /> As for the third question, the Anarchs have some control over the smuggling in and out of the city. One of the transports is done by a Gangrel gang, but the kindred responsible for making the transactions was destroyed and its ghoul disappeared. This caused friction with the Gangrel group that was accused. To summarize what happens next, the group was tasked with finding out what happened and if there is a third or fourth group involved.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T10:52:24-07:00","id":1539996,"title":"","content":"You could use an impersonator, a social character with less focus on being the group's face and more on being anyone, anywhere, to make observations without drawing attention.<br /> <br /> Any clan with either Auspex or Obfuscate could give the supernatural edge this character needs, although Malkavian does both. But even without supernatural powers geared towards this end they'll help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T13:58:53-07:00","id":1540010,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1539964-fourth-member?p=1539996#post1539996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could use an impersonator, a social character with less focus on being the group's face and more on being anyone, anywhere, to make observations without drawing attention.<br /> <br /> Any clan with either Auspex or Obfuscate could give the supernatural edge this character needs, although Malkavian does both. But even without supernatural powers geared towards this end they'll help.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, my mistake, I mentioned that Caitff has a discipline similar to Vicissitude, it allows him to change form quickly so he can play the role of an infringer, even in a different way, so it kind of won't work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-09T16:43:35-07:00","id":1540109,"title":"","content":"How about Ventrue who has connections to real estate brokers or construction and knows which places are good to hole up in when the heat is on. He or she is really good at reading people and knows what they want, but has a modest grasp of technology and is the diplomat of the group.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-09T17:30:42-07:00","id":1540110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1539964-fourth-member?p=1540109#post1540109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about Ventrue who has connections to real estate brokers or construction and knows which places are good to hole up in when the heat is on. He or she is really good at reading people and knows what they want, but has a modest grasp of technology and is the diplomat of the group.</div> </div> </div> </div>The part about him being good at reading people and having connections with real estate brokers seems like a good one, but I still need a background and just saying he was a estate broker himself doesn't give him much motivation. You have any ideias?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-09T17:39:51-07:00","id":1540111,"title":"","content":"Maybe the Ventrue had a falling out with his or her sire and wanted to forge their own path and become a pariah with there sire or maybe they caused said Ventrue's final death and used the resources to create his or her own powerbase and found some kinship with the coterie and sees them as a means he or she wasn't wrong in doing this. Perhaps said Ventrue is inspired by the example of Prince Seigfried of Vancouver who is quite independent of the Camarilla and clan politics and shown how successful he is. <br /> <br /> So maybe the Ventrue should have good ratings in Auspex and Presence in addition to solid social attributes and the awareness skill.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 08-10-2024, 03:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-10T12:22:42-07:00","id":1540139,"title":"","content":"Maybe you can have a Gangrel who isn't good with technology but is very good at spotting trouble as he might have a fugitive when he was human and could tell when they are wandering into a trap and is quite knowledgeable in effective evasion tactics that he can impart on the others when things go wrong. So he could know people who are good at smuggling or getting hard to find items from the black market.<br /> <br /> So I would give decent numbers in his in clan Disciplines and perhaps 1 or 2 dots in Auspex and near max traits in Survival and intimidation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-12T17:26:42-07:00","id":1540243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1539964-fourth-member?p=1540139#post1540139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe you can have a Gangrel who isn't good with technology but is very good at spotting trouble as he might have a fugitive when he was human and could tell when they are wandering into a trap and is quite knowledgeable in effective evasion tactics that he can impart on the others when things go wrong. So he could know people who are good at smuggling or getting hard to find items from the black market.<br /> <br /> So I would give decent numbers in his in clan Disciplines and perhaps 1 or 2 dots in Auspex and near max traits in Survival and intimidation.</div> </div> </div> </div>This concept of yours seems quite functional to me, but I would need to decide on the background better. Firstly, contact with contraband is already an area covered by the Monster, so I don't think I would give that much emphasis to this part. As an alternative concept, I thought of a former militiaman, an orphan raised on the streets, a private investigator or maybe an adrenaline junkie. Do you have experience with something similar?<br /> <br /> Also, I couldn't resist.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1539964-fourth-member?p=1540139#post1540139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> what would happen if I press this button?</div> </div> </div> </div>A series of explosives strategically positioned around the city. Once pressed, all our hideouts and important locations would be completely reduced to dust, covering our tracks and destroying any poor soul present in such places... or I don't know, it could make dozens of speakers play a fart noise. I don't know whose idea it was to put a Malkavian to design this thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-12T17:31:28-07:00","id":1540244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1539964-fourth-member?p=1540111#post1540111\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe the Ventrue had a falling out with his or her sire and wanted to forge their own path and become a pariah with there sire or maybe they caused said Ventrue's final death and used the resources to create his or her own powerbase and found some kinship with the coterie and sees them as a means he or she wasn't wrong in doing this. Perhaps said Ventrue is inspired by the example of Prince Seigfried of Vancouver who is quite independent of the Camarilla and clan politics and shown how successful he is.<br /> <br /> So maybe the Ventrue should have good ratings in Auspex and Presence in addition to solid social attributes and the awareness skill.</div> </div> </div> </div>It seems good to me, but there are two problems, the first is that I really don't know how to fit a reason for this character to ally with the other three I mean, he seems more like he would give them orders than treat them as a team, second it's not really a problem, but I think it would be better for this character to be a Toreador versed in politics or architecture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-12T18:17:47-07:00","id":1540251,"title":"","content":"A Toreador could work just as well and I'd never considered that clan at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}